e right to claim the  soul  it's yours it serve you well and your  children after you  the series could end with Daenerys  giving birth to her and John's child  this idea was kind of inspired by one of  gray areas videos  she said history may repeat with the  Tower of joy scene we could see this  happen again but instead it's Daenerys  laying in a bed of blood and John is  getting handed his child just as he was  handed to Ned I think that could be a  beautiful scene if that happened in it  mirrored John's birth but I want to take  it a step further and say this could be  the final scene it doesn't have to be in  a better blood or in a tower but I think  the series could end what Daenerys  giving birth and John holding his child  and they could zoom in on the baby's  eyes just like they did with John but it  could zoom all the way into the baby's  eye until it fades to black in the  credits roll I think they made it pretty  clear with all the foreshadowing that  Daenerys would get pregnant even though  she believes she can't since the last  season is only six episodes long she  probably wouldn't have the child until  the very end anyway that would be a  great last scene because it could end  with us knowing that they will have an  heir to follow in their footsteps and  carry the torch for the future  generations another way I could see this  show ending is what the remaining Starks  in Winterfell one of the last scenes in  season six was of John and Sansa  overlooking the battlements in a very  similar scene happened at the end of  season seven also but this time it was  Arya and Sansa overlooking the  battlements season eight could end with  all of the surviving Starks standing up  here reflecting and reminiscing about  everything that they have been through  or talking about Ned or possibly even  what the future may hold for them the  series started in Winterfell and I think  it could end in Winterfell it would only  feel right if the show ends with the  Starks bu